{"id":"3b41d55079073c1e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/519_模态逻辑_T.md","title":"519 模态逻辑 T","display":"519_模态逻辑_T","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{519}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{519}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对象语言的原始构造子只有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\n(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\n(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号不是原始构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{519}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{519}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{519}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{519})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{519}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{519})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由以下子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{519}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言没有绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{519}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{519}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{519}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{519}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{519}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{519}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span> 成立，并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,519}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{519},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,519}B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,519}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{519},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,519}B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是同一棵构造树。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{519}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{519}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{519})\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{519}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{519}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{519})\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{519}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{519}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{519}(\\sigma,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{519}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{519}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{519}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{519}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{519}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{519}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{519}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{519}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>正规分配公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{519}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{519}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{519}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{519}\n=\n\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{519}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{519}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{519}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{519}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>分离规则与必然化规则分别显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{519}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{519}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{519}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{519}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在含假设证明中，必然化只能作用于依赖集为空的较早行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>，从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"519\">\\(519\\)</span>-证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\)</span>。每行理由必须是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{519}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{519}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{519}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{519}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{519}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{519}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{519}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{519}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有这样的证明序列的集合。</p>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{519}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{519}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{519}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{519}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{519}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{519}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n(\\operatorname{last}_{519}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{519}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{519}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n(\\operatorname{last}_{519}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{519}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{519}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{519}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{519}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的特征增量是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{519}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{519}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{519}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合只由下列已定义公理族并成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{519}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{519}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{519}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{519}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{519}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{519}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{519},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{519},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{519},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{519},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,519},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{519},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{519},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{519},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{519},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{519},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{519},\n\\vdash_{519}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_{519}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{519},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{519},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{519},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{519},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,519},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{519},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{519},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{519},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{519},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{519},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{519},\n\\vdash_{519}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含命题模态句法、公理集合、推理规则、证明对象和可证性；不含 Kripke 框架、可达关系、赋值、满足或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qqua